        "Content": "C.10800 square feet / 1000 meter squared.  \r\n\r\nCommercial Unit to rent Old Dublin Road, Enniscorthy, Co. Wexford. \r\nPhoenix Estates are delighted to offer this C.10800 square feet commercial unit to rent. This property which is a self-contained unit with its own door, is in a prime location within easy reach of Enniscorthy Town and its facilities and has convenient access to the motorway. There is good parking space around the unit also. This unit has recently been refurbished and is in close proximity to many well established businesses.\r\n\r\nRent Negotiable\r\n\r\nLease terms negotiable"
